**Blocking finding — shield transfers through bounce/recast.**
`RegenerationShield` is keyed only by `ObjectId`; non-commander objects retain their id across zone changes (`insert_object`), and `move_to_hand` → `move_object_to_stack` → `enter_battlefield` reuses it. Shields are cleared only at cleanup. Reproduced against exact head: activate shield, Unsummon, recast the same Dragon-Scarred Bear, Shock it → bear remains **Battlefield** instead of going to the graveyard. The existing exile/bounce test misses this because it inserts a new object rather than recasting the bounced card.

